flowchart TD
  %% ICUM: IMU Controller UWB Measurements

  A[Tick] --> B[Consume radio]
  B --> C[Update neighbor table]
  C --> D[Read IMU]
  D --> E{State?}

  E -->|MOVING| M1[Fast HELLO]
  E -->|MOVING| M2[Fast RANGING_POLL]

  E -->|STATIONARY| S0{Topology changed recently?}
  S0 -->|Yes| S1[Fast HELLO]
  S0 -->|Yes| S2[Fast RANGING_POLL]

  S0 -->|No| S3{Need to learn? missing range and angle}
  S3 -->|Yes| S4[Send RANGING_POLL]
  S3 -->|No| S5[No periodic ranging]

  E -->|ISOLATED| I1[Mark isolated state]

  %% Reactive behavior
  R1[Receive RANGING_POLL] --> R2[Send RANGING_RESP immediately]

  %% Keepalive
  K1[Idle keepalive timer] --> K2[Slow HELLO]

  %% Notes
  note1["Event-driven mode reduces messages by avoiding periodic ranging when stationary+stable."]
  S5 -.-> note1
